  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shang clan ranking talk names Wu as the only force above Shang among those peers.",
      "chapters": [
        229
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later lines keep that ranking: even Wu clan, the number one clan in the southern borders, would not dare to use bone flesh unity Gu alone,",
      "chapters": [
        231
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_bone_flesh_unity_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and even the number one clan Wu clan does not have a mountain city as massive as Shang’s.",
      "chapters": [
        260
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Empress Wu Ji is the named Wu clan leader when Wu first enters that ranking talk.",
      "chapters": [
        228
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "empress-wu-ji-and-strength-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_empress_wu_ji"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s memory later states that she walks the strength path, and that an ancient strength path inheritance in Southern Border, already occupied and exploited by Wu Clan for several years, is why Wu Clan sits as the region’s number one force.",
      "chapters": [
        281
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "empress-wu-ji-and-strength-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eleven years before the Shang stretch, Wu clan leader Empress Wu Ji gives Wu Ran a secret mission in Shang Clan City, and the surname Wu is treated as the number one overlord of the southern border.",
      "chapters": [
        283
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "empress-wu-ji-and-strength-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As the number one clan dominating southern border, Wu clan sends Wu Lan Shan to San Cha Mountain. She is the younger cousin of the Wu clan leader, and she fights Wang Xiao to a draw while outperforming Ku Mo and Wu Gui.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "action-around-san-cha-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_lan_shan",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_wang_xiao",
        "char_ku_mo",
        "char_wu_gui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan elder Wu Hui stands in Xiao clan’s discussion hall demanding they hand over the culprit who killed his son, and Xiao clan’s elders hold the ground against him. Xiao Shan says his own daughter was only defending herself against Wu Hui’s son and that Wu Hui is using Wu clan to make a ruckus in the hall, and elder Xiao Zi Feng answers that Wu Hui is no problem but Wu clan is too powerful to resist.",
      "chapters": [
        962
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elders-demand-at-xiao-clan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xiao_clan",
        "char_xiao_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan sends elder Wu Shen Tong, a rank four peak stage enslavement path Gu Master, to lead the first wave of attack on Yi Tian Mountain, escorted by three rank four Gu Masters. A beast group storms the newly founded Yi Tian Village, and Xiao Shan, Sun Pang Hu, and Zhou Xing Xing force Wu Shen Tong to retreat with heavy injuries, though two rank four righteous path Gu Masters die in the fighting. The demonic path Gu Master Lu Zuan Feng relies on his infiltration methods to kill Wu Shen Tong and brings his head up the mountain, ending Wu clan’s first wave of offense.",
      "chapters": [
        965
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-wave-collapses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shen_tong",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "loc_yi_tian_village",
        "char_sun_pang_hu",
        "char_lu_zuan_feng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under Yi Tian Mountain’s gambling rules, the second mortal to take the stage is Wu clan Gu Immortal Wu Dang Zhi’s pawn, Wu Shen Tong. She picks someone of lower cultivation as the price of entering the mountain earlier. The clan forces the mission on Wu Shen Tong within a set timing, and its strictness leads him to suspect he has been made a sacrifice in a clan political conflict.",
      "chapters": [
        999
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wu-dang-zhis-gambit-at-yi-tian-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Dang Zhi’s pawn Wu Shen Tong is killed, and although she still refines much battle will from the clash, her own loss from it is the greatest of anyone’s. After this first wave, she remains unreconciled to the defeat.",
      "chapters": [
        1000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wu-dang-zhis-loss",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Shen Jing serves Wu clan as an ostracized but safe hidden elder, and sends his sister Wei De Xin a letter urging her to come serve Wu clan alongside him.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-shen-jings-position",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_shen_jing",
        "char_wei_de_xin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Du Xiu summons Wu Yong and several other Wu clan supreme elders to her house at her dying moments. She hands Wu clan to him, transfers her Immortal Gu because he also cultivates wind path, and dies. Wu clan’s supreme elders then pay respects to him as first supreme elder. The text states that Wu Du Xiu’s legend ends there and that Wu Yong, with rank eight cultivation, becomes the next first supreme elder of Wu clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1218
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-supreme-elder-line",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_du_xiu",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yi Hai sells his second batch of farmed dragonfish directly to Wu clan, which used to buy dragonfish from outside and can now treat the purchase as an internal sale.",
      "chapters": [
        1313
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dragonfish-supply-turns-internal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yi_hai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Like other super forces, Wu clan usually does not lightly offend any Gu Immortal, because a Gu Immortal who cannot be killed and escapes can destroy a large amount of a super force’s resources and become a lasting headache.",
      "chapters": [
        1317
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "restraint-toward-other-gu-immortals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Luo Mu Zi weighs Wu clan as beset by difficulties on all sides and lacking the initiative, yet still able to maintain its status, and says Wu Yong will stand behind Wu Yi Hai both publicly and privately.",
      "chapters": [
        1320
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-and-support-for-wu-yi-hai",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_luo_mu_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong summons Wu Yi Hai and offers three clan tasks: a wild Immortal Gu aura near Xuan Ming Mountain that borders Wu clan territory, rising water on red dragon river where part of the river flows past Wu clan and Qiao clan ground, and a birthday banquet at Yi clan. Elder Wu Bei is named as the Gu Immortal stationed at a super Gu formation who is injured when Ba clan creates difficulties, and first supreme elder swaps him with Wu Yi Hai so Wu Bei can return to recuperate. Gu Immortal Wu Fa intercepts Wu Yi Hai with those new orders, then returns to Wu clan’s Wu Yi Mountain and reports to Wu Yong.",
      "chapters": [
        1321
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wu-yi-mountain-and-named-elders",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_wild_immortal_gu",
        "fac_qiao_clan",
        "fac_yi_clan",
        "sys_super_gu_formation",
        "fac_ba_clan",
        "char_wu_fa",
        "loc_wu_yi_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "News spreads that Wu Yong has died, though more than ten days after he went missing the clan still does not know whether he is alive or dead. Yao clan, Yang clan, and Hou clan act together, costing Wu clan three resource points at once, Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian among them, and throwing its headquarters into chaos. Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian is a corpse mountain grown on the mangled body of a rank eight immortal zombie near the meeting of red dragon river and yellow dragon river, and it produces transformation path zombie Gu and qi path zombie qi Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1345
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "resource-points-lost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_yao_clan",
        "fac_yang_clan",
        "fac_hou_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yi Hai, representing Wu clan, sends Chai clan a letter proposing they work together to attack Xia clan and Ba clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1347
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "proposal-to-chai-clan-against-xia-and-ba-clan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_chai_clan",
        "fac_xia_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan’s headquarters are on Wu Yi Mountain at the extreme southwest of Southern Border. The intersection of yellow dragon river and red dragon river forms an X, and Wu clan territory sits at the lower part of that X, with Shang clan on the right side. The surroundings of Wu clan territories are isolated by yellow dragon river and red dragon river.",
      "chapters": [
        2067
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "headquarters-and-territory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The shore landmark is also catalogued as Wu Clan Shore.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "headquarters-and-territory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_wu_clan_shore"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian sits at a strategic whirlpool near that river junction, and Wu Yong stations rank seven Gu Immortal Wu Zhen there because the resource point has high productivity and a strategic position. Yao clan had seized the resource point from Wu clan before that, and Wu Yong took it back with Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building. Wu Yong has taken back every territory Wu clan lost. Wu Ba Chong appears in the same stretch as a Wu clan Gu Immortal who pledges allegiance to Wu Yong and is ordered to guard the headquarters while Wu Yong leaves with Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building.",
      "chapters": [
        2067
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "headquarters-and-territory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_zhen",
        "house_clear_jade_dripping_wind_tiny_bamboo_building",
        "char_wu_ba_chong"
      ]
    }
  ],
